  "body": "there are a couple of links to 'Receiving notifications' in the C-S spec which are broken. I think they are supposed to link to https://matrix.org/docs/spec/client_server/r0.6.1#id91.\n\n(They should use proper RST internal links, rather on relying on html-specific `#` fragments, so that future breakage is detected)",
